      "content": "it's not just a math problem though. it's everything. the shame is what kills me. every time i look at them, i just see what i've taken away from them by being so incompetent. it feels like a trap where every door is locked. sometimes i just sit here thinking about how much easier it would be if the pressure just... stopped. like, if there was just a way to make the noise and the stress and the failure just go away for good. it's the only thing that seems to make any sense anymore.",
